<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>$203,000 Copenhagen Open ATP tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>6-Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Lars Burgsmueller (Germany) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>2-Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat Frederik Fetterlein</p>
<p>(Denmark) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
